/-!
# Explicit bit-swap circuits for the Fi23 third prefix step

The six source and seven target circuits are generated from the unchanged
ATLAS prefix witnesses. Stage disjointness is kernel checked below. Equality
of their index maps with the published permutations is a separate certificate
(`SecondAgreement` and `SignedAgreement` in `Checker`); these definitions do not assert that equality.

Source: ATLAS F23G1-p31671B0; GLS3 Table 5.3u. Reproduce with
`Schreier/source/Generate.py`, after `KernelUpper/source/Generate.g`.
-/

set_option Elab.async false

@[expose] public section
